    req: ["ZP V.1"],
    q: String.raw`<p>Wyznacz dziedzinę funkcji \(f(x)=\dfrac{\sqrt{x^2-x-6}}{x-4}\).</p>`,
    ans: String.raw`\(D_f=(-\infty,-2]\cup[3,4)\cup(4,\infty)\)`,
    sol: String.raw`<div class="fig-wrap" data-sf="1"><svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 330 92" width="330" height="92" role="img" aria-label="Dziedzina funkcji: (−∞,−2], [3,4) i (4,∞)"><line class="gr d" x1="83.2" y1="10" x2="83.2" y2="56"/><line class="gr d" x1="125.5" y1="10" x2="125.5" y2="56"/><line class="gr d" x1="167.8" y1="10" x2="167.8" y2="56"/><line class="gr d" x1="231.3" y1="10" x2="231.3" y2="56"/><line class="gr d" x1="252.5" y1="10" x2="252.5" y2="56"/><line class="gr d" x1="294.8" y1="10" x2="294.8" y2="56"/><line class="ax w" x1="56" y1="28" x2="320" y2="28"/><line class="tha" x1="56" y1="28" x2="125.5" y2="28"/><circle class="dota" cx="125.5" cy="28" r="3.2"/><line class="tha" x1="231.3" y1="28" x2="252.5" y2="28"/><circle class="dota" cx="231.3" cy="28" r="3.2"/><circle class="holea" cx="252.5" cy="28" r="3.4"/><line class="tha" x1="252.5" y1="28" x2="320" y2="28"/><circle class="holea" cx="252.5" cy="28" r="3.4"/><text class="b" x="6" y="33" text-anchor="start">D</text><line class="ax" x1="56" y1="70" x2="317" y2="70"/><polygon class="ah" points="322,70 315,72.9 315,67.1"/><line class="ax" x1="83.2" y1="66" x2="83.2" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="83.2" y="87" text-anchor="middle">−4</text><line class="ax" x1="125.5" y1="66" x2="125.5" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="125.5" y="87" text-anchor="middle">−2</text><line class="ax" x1="167.8" y1="66" x2="167.8" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="167.8" y="87" text-anchor="middle">0</text><line class="ax" x1="231.3" y1="66" x2="231.3" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="231.3" y="87" text-anchor="middle">3</text><line class="ax" x1="252.5" y1="66" x2="252.5" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="252.5" y="87" text-anchor="middle">4</text><line class="ax" x1="294.8" y1="66" x2="294.8" y2="74"/><text class="m" x="294.8" y="87" text-anchor="middle">6</text></svg></div>
<p class="step"><b>Warunki.</b> Wyrażenie pod pierwiastkiem musi być nieujemne: \(x^2-x-6\ge0\), a mianownik różny od zera: \(x\ne4\).</p>
<p class="step"><b>Nierówność.</b> \(x^2-x-6=(x-3)(x+2)\ge0\iff x\le-2\) lub \(x\ge3\).</p>
<p class="step"><b>Część wspólna z \(x\ne4\).</b> Liczba \(4\) należy do \([3,\infty)\), więc ją wyłączamy: \(D_f=(-\infty,-2]\cup[3,4)\cup(4,\infty)\).</p>`
